  "Overview": "Age of Booty is a real-time multiplayer strategy game that puts players at the helm of their own pirate ship with the goal of sending their enemies to the briny deep while looting and capturing towns for their pirate faction.\n\nIn the game, players team up with other online players or AI-controlled pirate ships to raid, pillage, sink, and destroy their way to dominance on the high seas. Spoils of war and booty are used to upgrade and customize pirate ships to make them even more deadly as players take on 25 unique challenges and seven of the most devious Pirate Alliances on the high seas. Gain notoriety and fame by climbing the online leader boards. Create and share custom maps using the intuitive map creation system.",
